_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMTY1MzMyNjg2ODAyOTAyNTE1NDA3NzUyMzE0Mjg1NTM%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjkwMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl91cGxvYWRlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=WuMJJnlfisEQ7kNvwGk07D5&_nc_oc=AdrdP0y6HaQ237dVPFrw6-9fqdOAVBDWifEu9lELOCOhyq6h2ysnRNSfWF2stT-uBp1lP0NzoQJjoUpS7A59X3RB&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna&_nc_gid=0U6sYWSFFVFZNtxEDf-cJw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQT4u1Xe7McEomYOlB7gOBHiUDT2aHRjSZkzZsYAjY01Cw&oe=6AF828FE", "width": 900, "height": 900, "id": "11", "resolution": "900x900"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/885149263_1540775234761886_8332162361446051091_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMTY1MzMyNjg2ODAyOTAyNTE1NDA3NzUyMzE0Mjg1NTM%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjkwMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl91cGxvYWRlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=WuMJJnlfisEQ7kNvwGk07D5&_nc_oc=AdrdP0y6HaQ237dVPFrw6-9fqdOAVBDWifEu9lELOCOhyq6h2ysnRNSfWF2stT-uBp1lP0NzoQJjoUpS7A59X3RB&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna&_nc_gid=0U6sYWSFFVFZNtxEDf-cJw&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQQ_yLKuEaJVMZhsaqGfvUhRdHda-9utqEx5qGxTiE2wqg&oe=6AF828FE", "width": 900, "height": 1600, "id": "12", "resolution": "900x1600"}], "comments": [{"author": "syed_sam_", "author_id": "2233997941", "id": "18113038490523441", "text": "Par mèi toh avalanche kei niche dab gya 😂", "timestamp": 1794251902, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "illuvillette", "author_id": "66678458649", "id": "17918930823264986", "text": "Sleeping in -40° can cause you Hyperthermia and it would lead you to death that's why sleeping there is a bad idea. Descending is the only way to stay alive.", "timestamp": 1794233334, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "vikaash_sharmaa", "author_id": "8037212356", "id": "18114904079265460", "text": "B", "timestamp": 1794213378, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "abk_abhi_2k26", "author_id": "26451880485", "id": "18136015069739934", "text": "B", "timestamp": 1794211782, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "johnson_toppo", "author_id": "3656243371", "id": "17904610527376735", "text": "People saying B which is rest and you know resting on everest is rest in peace, it's always descend until you reach base camp.", "timestamp": 1794205740, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "thisisshafkat", "author_id": "40135818739", "id": "18145751365591798", "text": "B", "timestamp": 1794151053, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "yadavlakshman389", "author_id": "6022920283", "id": "18120693934777799", "text": "Bhaai part 2 do jldi fas gyaa hu thand badhne lgi hai 😢", "timestamp": 1794078671, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ayush_rajput2134", "author_id": "8798854697", "id": "18110252297524765", "text": "People are choosing options. Nobody there to think that why to go in December and also they are on there way at 3:30 for summit , it the time when you should almost at (camp 4 Decent)", "timestamp": 1794075256, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "mr_mostafarajabi", "author_id": "7818435535", "id": "18118326041088094", "text": "The real and original name is #sagarmatha not Everest\n\nThis Mountain 🏔️ is belongs to the people of #Nepal not a British man or his country", "timestamp": 1794005648, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "hatttttt48", "author_id": "52169611270", "id": "18134972500763933", "text": "B", "timestamp": 1793985453, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "whoismilind_", "author_id": "77609093787", "id": "18455965636133057", "text": "First of all, since I have set out to climb Everest, I will return only after completing the climb. Secondly, if everyone I came with is already gone, I have nothing left to lose—so there is no point in going back. There are only two options: either perish there along with everyone else, or successfully conquer Everest.", "timestamp": 1793926036, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kumreharshal", "author_id": "4040655954", "id": "18105186428637812", "text": "A", "timestamp": 1793915889, "like_count": 0}], "w